## 6. Build and Execution Instructions

### Compile

```bash
gcc -std=c11 -Wall -Wextra -I. config_validator.c test_config_validator.c unity/src/unity.c -o test_runner
```
### Run

```bash
./test_runner
```

## 7. Project Limitations
This project is intended for unit testing on a host environment.

We have not performed configuration deployment to actual network devices, hardware verification, or network communication testing.
